    "Marked LEdge objects are private fresh identities; only real add membership then final clear in this lifecycle. HashSet->non-string InternalHashCodeMap->ES Map entries->key view/collection string chain checked. A side observation of first successful actual add preserves this specific lifecycle order without changing membership or any mathematical decision.",
    "Do not generalize insertion order to arbitrary HashSet/string keys/collisions/removals/private public-H copies. Class/blocks collections preserve their explicit LinkedHashMap/LinkedHashSet encounter order.",
    "Edge/port designation transitive D34/D35 now covered: actual owner.ports index fallback, edge label/origin, node label/origin/layer index; no address/traceID/sorted substitutions.",
    "Source string/list/map punctuation and null/object virtual bridge checked. Source D39 is ECMAScript intrinsic Number string coercion, not an elkjs formatter algorithm.",
    "Crosschecked raw64 official logs: cycle chooses RIGHTUP while chain RIGHTDOWN;long-edge node text n(long_edge)_0; actual direction PRE/POST names and repeated class slot names retained."
